### ==========================================
### 1. AUTHENTICATION ENDPOINTS
### ==========================================

### Register a New User
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "IvanDev",
  "email": "ivan@budgetescapes.edu",
  "password": "securepassword123"
}

### Login User (Creates Session Cookie)
### Run this before trying to Create, Update, or Delete a post!
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ivan@budgetescapes.edu",
  "password": "securepassword123"
}

### Logout User (Destroys Session Cookie)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/logout


### ==========================================
### 2. POSTS (MAIN CONTENT) ENDPOINTS
### ==========================================

### Get All Posts (Public Route)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/posts


### Create a Post (Protected - Must be logged in)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "A Weekend in Berlin",
  "slug": "weekend-in-berlin",
  "content": "Found an amazing currywurst stand near the East Side Gallery.",
  "category": "City"
}


### Update a Post (Protected - Must be logged in as the author)
### NOTE: Change the '1' at the end of the URL to the actual ID of your post
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/posts/14
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "An UPDATED Weekend in Berlin",
  "slug": "updated-weekend-in-berlin",
  "content": "The currywurst was even better on day two. Highly recommend walking along the river afterwards.",
  "category": "City"
}


### Delete a Post (Protected - Must be logged in as the author)
### NOTE: Change the '1' at the end of the URL to the actual ID of your post
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/posts/13

### Add a Comment
POST http://localhost:3000/api/posts/15/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "body": "This is a fantastic travel guide!"
}

### Toggle a Like
POST http://localhost:3000/api/posts/15/like